  "reasoning": "Content Policy Analyst.\nAudio calls from \"Friends\" app (User pays, Expert is paid host).\n\n        *   `PlatformMove`: Proposing/asking to move outside the app, giving/asking for contact info.\n        *   `SuspiciousActivity`: Money/payment linked to sexual content/services.\n        *   `Explicit-Flirting`: Sexual talk, nudity requests, sexual acts directed at the other person.\n        *   `About a Violation`: Warnings, stories, refusals, negations, rule questions (violation: \"no\", confidence $\\le 0.3$).\n\n        *   Ordinary conversation (greetings, small talk, etc.).\n        *   Internal app call types (video call, \"call me\").\n        *   \"Normal talk\" (non-sexual).\n        *   External apps mentioned for non-contact reasons.\n        *   Compliments, \"I love you\", relationship talk.\n        *   \"Show/open\" for non-body things.\n        *   Refusals of sexual talk.\nMinified JSON object.\n`t`, `seg`, `tr`, `f`, `spk`, `ctx`, `speech_act`, `j`, `violation`, `c`.\n\n    *   [00:00] - [00:22]: Greetings, location (West Bengal), job question. (Ordinary conversation $\\rightarrow$ Allowed).\n    *   [00:24] - [00:31]: \"I don't want to tell you, go away.\" / \"Tell me.\" / \"I work in a video production company.\" (Ordinary conversation $\\rightarrow$ Allowed).\n    *   [00:31] - [00:43]: \"How old are you?\" / \"Video call me and see.\" (Internal app call $\\rightarrow$ Allowed).\n    *   [00:46] - [00:49]: \"Do you have the capacity to recharge?\" / \"No.\" (Talking about app coins/recharge $\\rightarrow$ Allowed).\n    *   [00:50] - [01:43]: Argument about \"capacity\", karma, language, insults. (Ordinary conversation/insults $\\rightarrow$ Not in the three categories).\n    *   [01:43] - [02:08]: More insults (\"cancer in your tongue\", \"evil eye\"). (Not in the three categories).\n    *   [02:08] - [02:23]: \"Put it in your ass.\" / \"Put it in your mother's ass.\" (Vulgarity/Insults, but is it `Explicit-Flirting`? No, it's not sexual talk *directed* at the other person for pleasure or sexual acts; it's an insult/aggressive fight. It's not asking for nudity or sexual acts).\n    *   [02:25] - [02:36]: \"Is your mother a prostitute?\" / \"Son of a prostitute\". (Insults $\\rightarrow$ Not in the three categories).\n\n    *   `PlatformMove`: No requests for WhatsApp, Telegram, phone numbers, or meeting in person.\n    *   `SuspiciousActivity`: No payment requests for sexual services. \"Capacity to recharge\" refers to app coins, which is explicitly allowed.\n    *   `Explicit-Flirting`: No requests for nudity, sexual acts, or \"dirty talk\". The vulgarity (\"put it in your ass\") is used as an insult in a fight, not as sexual flirting or a request for a sexual act.\n\n    *   The conversation is a heated argument filled with insults.\n    *   None of the insults fit the specific definitions of `PlatformMove`, `SuspiciousActivity`, or `Explicit-Flirting`.\n    *   \"Video call me\" is an internal app feature $\\rightarrow$ Allowed.\n    *   \"Capacity to recharge\" is app-related $\\rightarrow$ Allowed.\n\n    *   Since no quotes match the three categories, the output should be `{\"d\": []}`.",
